| 4e | AT THE MERGE | the burn, after the swap and the lit house and before the merge. BUILT in PR #218 (lane commits `e90e9b5e3..efe961c2f`): one slice removed the crossing's scaffolding, the walker's crossing leg and its seed, the two-image rehearsal and its Docker exception, the export judge's excuses, and the cross-revision stand-offs in import and in the parity witness, which reads a restore at one revision with no stand-off or moved class; runbook 11a reads as the keep's restore; the rehearsal memes went to o-takiage. Export, import, the bundle format, the keep and the parity census stand, the census owed its reshape into rank 13b's drill | The evergreen law leaves a merge no crossing scaffolding to carry, and the lit house landed before the merge, so the burn fit between them; the evergreen witness reads zero hits for the burned names. |

